Q: Blogger: Contempo template have managed to get the posts to post in full but there is still a &quot;snippet&quot; of the post at the bottom of each full post A: <p>1- Search using <code>ctrl+F</code> for <code>&lt;b:includable id='postBodySnippet' var='post'&gt;</code> you'll find two results we will work on the second result.</p>

<p>2- Select starting of the mentioned line till nearest <code>&lt;/b:includable&gt;</code> and replace with these lines:</p>

<pre class="lang-xml prettyprint-override"><code>&lt;b:includable id='postBodySnippet' var='post'&gt;
  &lt;div class='container post-body entry-content' expr:id='"post-snippet-" + data:post.id'&gt;
    &lt;data:post.body/&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/b:includable&gt;
</code></pre>

<p>3- Don't forget to press <code>Save Theme</code> button</p>

