Q: How to access shared mailbox using Microsoft Graph in .net core A: <p>Found the problem, I hadn't set the appSettings correctly.</p>

<p>I added "User.Read Mail.Read.Shared" to my PrivateSettings.Config as shown:</p>

<pre><code>   &lt;add key="ida:AppScopes" value="User.Read Calendars.Read" /&gt;
&lt;add key="ida:AppScopes" value="User.Read Mail.Read" /&gt;
&lt;add key="ida:AppScopes" value="User.Read Mail.Read.Shared" /&gt;
</code></pre>

<p>Hope this helps someone.</p>
